# Clerk PUBLISHABLE key — public by design. Vite inlines VITE_* values into the
# client bundle every browser downloads, so committing this is safe (the SECRET
# key, sk_*, is NOT here — it lives only in the Worker via `wrangler secret put`).
# Committing it makes `npm run build` self-contained: the deploy no longer
# depends on a Cloudflare dashboard variable. A dashboard-set value, if present,
# still takes precedence over this file.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_Y2xlcmsuY2hlZmZsb3cudWsk
